OL,3,GNEWSANaked calendar raises thousands
OL,4,Afor cancer charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nude calendar put together by
OL,7,Fvolunteers has raised thousands of
OL,8,Fpounds in aid of the charity Blood
OL,9,FCancer UK.
OL,11,FThe calendar was created by the cast of
OL,12,FGlastonbury & Street Musical Comedy
OL,13,FSociety's (GSMCS) production of the
OL,14,Fmusical Calendar Girls.
OL,16,FIt features well known faces from the
OL,17,FSomerset town, who this week handed a
OL,18,Fcheque for #3,000 over to the charity
OL,19,Fafter selling hundreds of copies and
OL,20,Fcollecting donations at their shows in
OL,21,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
