OL,3,GNEWSANaked calendar raises thousands
OL,4,Afor cancer charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We had such great fun staging the show
OL,7,Fand stripping down for the naked
OL,8,Fcalendar, and we're hugely grateful to
OL,9,Fthose who donated," said Mary Parker,
OL,10,Fwho also produced the musical.
